    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Weed Shop Simulator</strong>, the ultimate first-person business sim where you build a sprawling marijuana empire from seed to sale. Grow, craft, and sell your way to the top in a vibrant, chaotic world full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Master the Science of Cultivation</strong><br>Start with classic strains and dive deep into advanced crossbreeding to create rare, powerful hybrids. Experiment endlessly to unlock a diverse botanical collection that sets your shop apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Craft Legendary Cannabis Products</strong><br>Roll custom blunts, produce premium solventless concentrates, and stock your shelves with everything from stylish bongs \ud83d\udca8 to exclusive gear. Every product adds to your prestige and profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Build &amp; Lead Your Dream Team</strong><br>Hire skilled growers and staff to boost production and streamline your operation. Manage your workforce carefully to maintain quality and grow your empire faster than rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Outsmart Rival Dealers &amp; Protect Your Turf</strong><br>Face intense underground competition. Outsmart enemies, defend your reputation, and dominate the cannabis scene with street smarts and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc2c <strong>Dive Into Wild Adventures &amp; Unexpected Fun</strong><br>Make influencer friends, ride dolphins, and embrace the hilarious chaos that makes this world truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9a <strong>Weed Shop Simulator</strong> isn\u2019t just a game \u2014 it\u2019s an expansive journey into cannabis culture packed with deep mechanics and endless content.<br>Are you ready to rise, reign, and rewrite the rules of the weed business? Your empire awaits! \ud83c\udf3f\ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Weed Shop Simulator</strong>, the ultimate first-person business sim where you build a sprawling marijuana empire from seed to sale. Grow, craft, and sell your way to the top in a vibrant, chaotic world full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Master the Science of Cultivation</strong><br>Start with classic strains and dive deep into advanced crossbreeding to create rare, powerful hybrids. Experiment endlessly to unlock a diverse botanical collection that sets your shop apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Craft Legendary Cannabis Products</strong><br>Roll custom blunts, produce premium solventless concentrates, and stock your shelves with everything from stylish bongs \ud83d\udca8 to exclusive gear. Every product adds to your prestige and profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Build &amp; Lead Your Dream Team</strong><br>Hire skilled growers and staff to boost production and streamline your operation. Manage your workforce carefully to maintain quality and grow your empire faster than rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Outsmart Rival Dealers &amp; Protect Your Turf</strong><br>Face intense underground competition. Outsmart enemies, defend your reputation, and dominate the cannabis scene with street smarts and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc2c <strong>Dive Into Wild Adventures &amp; Unexpected Fun</strong><br>Make influencer friends, ride dolphins, and embrace the hilarious chaos that makes this world truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9a <strong>Weed Shop Simulator</strong> isn\u2019t just a game \u2014 it\u2019s an expansive journey into cannabis culture packed with deep mechanics and endless content.<br>Are you ready to rise, reign, and rewrite the rules of the weed business? Your empire awaits! \ud83c\udf3f\ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "short_description": "Weed Shop Simulator launches in Early Access! \ud83c\udf3f Build your cannabis empire from seed to sale. Grow rare strains, craft legendary products, hire your team, and outsmart rivals in a chaotic world full of wild adventures and deep cannabis culture. Your empire awaits!",
